A sniffer for suspicious odors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A portable pustule scanner</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/ebb2f28d7293141fc6b8d99934bf63b7.avif?t=1768406607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.poster.avif?t=1768406607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.webm?t=1768406607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/777f327421cc1cc6fedce63463e0b335.mp4?t=1768406607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The right treatment for every patient.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a range of illnesses, each more absurd than the last, you will need to identify the correct symptoms and make a diagnosis that will affect your paycheck no matter what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it wrong, or you may find the unfortunate patient in the obituary section of the next day's newspaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e9446999291a3cdebe175129a2db7911.avif?t=1768406607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e68f4